  ┌────────────────────────────── Run for each ──────────────────────────────┐  
  │ Runs once per selected item. Default mode must include %f (iterated ite… │  
  │ Other macros: %d active dir, %F/%D other panel, %t/%T tagged paths.      │  
  │ Do not wrap % macros in quotes.                                          │  
  │ >> | && etc. run via sh -c; otherwise argv is parsed without a shell.    │  
  │                                                                          │  
  │ Check "Run in each selected directory" (Alt+R) to cd into each selected… │  
  │ If enabled; %f becomes optional.                                         │  
  ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  
  │ Command:                                                                 │  
  │ gzip -9 %f                                                               │  
  │ Selection must contain only directories                                  │  
  ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  
